.TH tkudavaccount n 0.31.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkudavaccount \- DAV account form with connection test
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkudavaccount
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkudavaccount::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Form for server URL / user / password / type with a Test connection button that
runs a PROPFIND through tclutils::tudav. See docs/tkudavaccount.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils::tudav(n), tkutils::tkuform(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, dav, carddav, caldav, account
